Hi there,

most handling is documented:
adegenetTutorial("basics")

section 5.1. See also the manpage for most accessors:
?nLoc

For instance, to exclude the Salers from microbov:
x <- microbov[i=!as.character(pop(microbov)) %in% c("Salers")]

Cheers
Thibaut


